# docs/manual (S-DOC-2): version the modular SOURCE, not the build artefacts.
# O-SW-09 decision — the .docx is built by `node docs/manual/build.mjs` (and an
# optional CI job), never committed; figures and node_modules are generated.
docs/manual/node_modules/
docs/manual/OptiVibe_Руководство.docx
docs/manual/figures/*.png

# docs/theory (SW-53): version the Markdown+LaTeX SOURCE, not the build.
# O-SW-04/O-SW-09 — HTML built locally by `python docs/theory/tools/build_theory.py`,
# never committed; the vendored (offline) MathJax runtime is not committed either.
docs/theory/_build/
docs/theory/tools/mathjax/
